    "detailed_description": "Brought to you by a solo indie game developer: Rewild takes you on a mysterious adventure as you follow the trail of your missing uncle, who was not just a farmer but also a brilliant engineer. After a mysterious crater appears and your uncle vanishes, you uncover a world filled with secrets. Alongside unexpected allies, including a detective and an intelligent species struggling with the effects of pollution, you unravel a deep conspiracy. Can you restore balance between worlds and save your uncle\u2019s legacy? Discover the answer in this immersive and challenging adventure.",
